一、完整 Kubernetes 資源配置清單（以 kustomize 管理）

建議在 reinsurance-core-service（或統一的部署目錄）中建立如下的 k8s/ 結構：

k8s/
├── namespace.yaml
├── postgres.yaml
├── core-service.yaml
├── web-portal.yaml
├── ingress.yaml
└── kustomization.yaml
1. k8s/namespace.yaml
yaml
apiVersion: v1
kind: Namespace
metadata:
  name: reinsurance
2. k8s/postgres.yaml (專屬 PostgreSQL 16 StatefulSet)
yaml
apiVersion: apps/v1
kind: StatefulSet
metadata:
  name: reinsurance-postgres
  namespace: reinsurance
spec:
  serviceName: reinsurance-postgres
  replicas: 1
  selector:
    matchLabels:
      app: reinsurance-postgres
  template:
    metadata:
      labels:
        app: reinsurance-postgres
    spec:
      containers:
        - name: postgres
          image: postgres:16-alpine
          ports:
            - containerPort: 5432
              name: postgres
          env:
            - name: POSTGRES_DB
              value: app_db
            - name: POSTGRES_USER
              value: dev_user
            - name: POSTGRES_PASSWORD
              valueFrom:
                secretKeyRef:
                  name: reinsurance-secrets
                  key: DB_PASSWORD
          resources:
            requests:
              cpu: 100m
              memory: 256Mi
            limits:
              cpu: 500m
              memory: 512Mi
          volumeMounts:
            - name: pgdata
              mountPath: /var/lib/postgresql/data
  volumeClaimTemplates:
    - metadata:
        name: pgdata
      spec:
        accessModes: ["ReadWriteOnce"]
        storageClassName: local-path
        resources:
          requests:
            storage: 10Gi
---
apiVersion: v1
kind: Service
metadata:
  name: reinsurance-postgres
  namespace: reinsurance
spec:
  ports:
    - port: 5432
      targetPort: 5432
  selector:
    app: reinsurance-postgres
3. k8s/core-service.yaml (Spring Boot 3.2 後端)
yaml
apiVersion: apps/v1
kind: Deployment
metadata:
  name: reinsurance-core
  namespace: reinsurance
spec:
  replicas: 1
  selector:
    matchLabels:
      app: reinsurance-core
  template:
    metadata:
      labels:
        app: reinsurance-core
    spec:
      containers:
        - name: core
          image: reinsurance-core:latest
          imagePullPolicy: IfNotPresent
          ports:
            - containerPort: 8080
              name: http
          env:
            - name: SPRING_PROFILES_ACTIVE
              value: prod
            - name: SPRING_DATASOURCE_URL
              value: "jdbc:postgresql://reinsurance-postgres:5432/app_db"
            - name: SPRING_DATASOURCE_USERNAME
              value: dev_user
            - name: SPRING_DATASOURCE_PASSWORD
              valueFrom:
                secretKeyRef:
                  name: reinsurance-secrets
                  key: DB_PASSWORD
            - name: JWT_SECRET
              valueFrom:
                secretKeyRef:
                  name: reinsurance-secrets
                  key: JWT_SECRET
          resources:
            requests:
              cpu: 200m
              memory: 512Mi
            limits:
              cpu: 1000m
              memory: 1Gi
          readinessProbe:
            httpGet:
              path: /actuator/health/readiness
              port: 8080
            initialDelaySeconds: 20
            periodSeconds: 10
          livenessProbe:
            httpGet:
              path: /actuator/health/liveness
              port: 8080
            initialDelaySeconds: 40
            periodSeconds: 15
---
apiVersion: v1
kind: Service
metadata:
  name: reinsurance-core
  namespace: reinsurance
spec:
  ports:
    - port: 8080
      targetPort: 8080
      name: http
  selector:
    app: reinsurance-core
4. k8s/web-portal.yaml (Next.js 14 前端)
yaml
apiVersion: apps/v1
kind: Deployment
metadata:
  name: reinsurance-web
  namespace: reinsurance
spec:
  replicas: 1
  selector:
    matchLabels:
      app: reinsurance-web
  template:
    metadata:
      labels:
        app: reinsurance-web
    spec:
      containers:
        - name: web
          image: reinsurance-web:latest
          imagePullPolicy: IfNotPresent
          ports:
            - containerPort: 3000
              name: http
          env:
            - name: NODE_ENV
              value: production
            - name: PORT
              value: "3000"
            - name: NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL
              value: "/api" # 同網域相對路徑，徹底避免 CORS
          resources:
            requests:
              cpu: 100m
              memory: 256Mi
            limits:
              cpu: 500m
              memory: 512Mi
          readinessProbe:
            httpGet:
              path: /
              port: 3000
            initialDelaySeconds: 10
            periodSeconds: 5
---
apiVersion: v1
kind: Service
metadata:
  name: reinsurance-web
  namespace: reinsurance
spec:
  ports:
    - port: 3000
      targetPort: 3000
      name: http
  selector:
    app: reinsurance-web
5. k8s/ingress.yaml (Traefik 整合網關)
yaml
apiVersion: networking.k8s.io/v1
kind: Ingress
metadata:
  name: reinsurance-ingress
  namespace: reinsurance
  annotations:
    traefik.ingress.kubernetes.io/router.entrypoints: web,websecure
spec:
  ingressClassName: traefik
  rules:
    - host: reinsurance.fsc1.homes # 若要直連 IP，亦可加一組不帶 host 的規則
      http:
        paths:
          - path: /api
            pathType: Prefix
            backend:
              service:
                name: reinsurance-core
                port:
                  number: 8080
          - path: /
            pathType: Prefix
            backend:
              service:
                name: reinsurance-web
                port:
                  number: 3000
6. k8s/kustomization.yaml
yaml
apiVersion: kustomize.config.k8s.io/v1beta1
kind: Kustomization
namespace: reinsurance
resources:
  - namespace.yaml
  - postgres.yaml
  - core-service.yaml
  - web-portal.yaml
  - ingress.yaml
images:
  - name: reinsurance-core
    newName: reinsurance-core
    newTag: latest
  - name: reinsurance-web
    newName: reinsurance-web
    newTag: latest
二、GitHub Actions 完整自動化 Workflow

以 reinsurance-core-service 的 .github/workflows/deploy.yml 為例：

yaml
name: Deploy Core Service to fsc1-vm01
on:
  push:
    branches: [main]
  workflow_dispatch:
concurrency:
  group: deploy-reinsurance-core
  cancel-in-progress: false
jobs:
  deploy:
    name: 建置並部署到 k3s (140.110.146.247)
    runs-on: [self-hosted, linux, fsc1-vm01]
    environment: production
    steps:
      - name: Checkout Code with Submodules
        uses: actions/checkout@v4
        with:
          submodules: recursive
          # 若 contracts 為私有 Repo，需配置具備 repo 讀取權限的 PAT
          token: ${{ secrets.SUBMODULE_ACCESS_TOKEN || github.token }}
      - name: 建立 Kubernetes 密鑰 (初次或更新)
        run: |
          kubectl apply -f k8s/namespace.yaml
          kubectl -n reinsurance create secret generic reinsurance-secrets \
            --from-literal=DB_PASSWORD="${{ secrets.DB_PASSWORD }}" \
            --from-literal=JWT_SECRET="${{ secrets.JWT_SECRET }}" \
            --dry-run=client -o yaml | kubectl apply -f -
      - name: 建置 Docker 映像檔
        run: docker build -t reinsurance-core:${{ github.sha }} .
      - name: 匯入映像檔至 k3s containerd
        run: docker save reinsurance-core:${{ github.sha }} | sudo -n /usr/local/bin/k3s ctr images import -
      - name: 套用更新 (GitOps)
        run: |
          cd k8s
          sed -i "s|newName: reinsurance-core.*|newName: reinsurance-core\n    newTag: \"${{ github.sha }}\"|" kustomization.yaml
          kubectl apply -k .
      - name: 等待服務就緒
        run: |
          kubectl -n reinsurance rollout status deployment/reinsurance-core --timeout=300s
      - name: 清理本機暫存映像檔
        if: always()
        run: docker image rm reinsurance-core:${{ github.sha }} || true
三、一步步落地實施計畫 (Implementation Checklist)
GitHub 端前置作業：
 在 GitHub 個人帳號建立一個具備 repo 讀取權限的 Personal Access Token (PAT)。
 在 reinsurance-core-service 與 reinsurance-web-portal 的 Settings → Secrets 設定 SUBMODULE_ACCESS_TOKEN，讓 CI 能拉取 reinsurance-contracts。
 在兩專案的 Environments 建立 production 並填寫 DB_PASSWORD 與 JWT_SECRET。
專案程式碼配置：
 在 web-portal 的 next.config.js 加入 output: 'standalone'。
 將上述 Dockerfile 分別放入兩專案根目錄。
 將 k8s/ 目錄提交至專案版控。
VM 執行驗收：
 推送程式碼觸發 Actions 部署。
 登入 VM PuTTY 執行：
bash
kubectl -n reinsurance get pods,svc,ingress
 驗證資料庫 V1__baseline.sql 自動遷移完成，且前後端服務狀態均為 Running！
